* Operational amplifier
* Specifications, with Cload= 50fF 
*            Min   Typ   Max                    
* Voffset    -1    0.3   1    mV
* Vpp_1MHz   700   900   1000 mV
* delay_1MHz 0     50    120  ns
* Iddq       0     0.1   0.3  uA  
* 
* in/out nodes
* inn    : inverting input
* inp    : non-inverting input
* out    : analog output
* pd     : power-down digital input, active high
* xpd    : pd-inverted digital input
* vdda   : 3.3 VDC, power in 
* vssa   : ground
*.subckt OPAMP1 inn inp out pd xpd vdda vssa 




X1 out inp out pd xpd vdda 0  OPAMP1




VDD vdda 0 vddnom

Cload  out   0  50e-15

* Test description
* non-inverting buffer configuration; measure output-input offset, then apply 1Vp-p @ 2 MHz, and measure output Vp-p and phase delay
*               Voff Vampl freq
Vin  inp  0 sin(1.65 0.5 1meg)  
*Vin  inp  0 DC 1 AC 1  
Vpd  pd   0 pwl(0,        0,
+               2u,       0,
+               2.1u,    vddnom)
Vxpd xpd  0 pwl(0,       vddnom,
+               2u,      vddnom,
+               2.1u,     0)
*.AC DEC 20 1k 100meg
*.MEAS AC GainDC FIND v(out) AT=1k
*.MEAS AC Bandwidth WHEN v(out)=0.707 FALL=1
*.MEAS AC Freq_Unitaire WHEN v(out)=1 FALL=1
.MEAS Voffset    FIND v(out,inp) at=0                                    
.MEAS Vpp@1MHz   PP   v(out) from=0.2u to=1.8u                            
.MEAS delay      TRIG v(inp) val=1.65 td=10n TARG v(out) val=1.65 td=50n  
.MEAS Iddq       FIND i(VDD) at=2.2u                                      

.INCLUDE subcircuit_files/OPAMP1.sub
.INCLUDE subcircuit_files/PRIMITIVE.sub

*.INCLUDE process_models/fastN_fastP.process
*.INCLUDE process_models/slowN_fastP.process
.INCLUDE process_models/typical.process
*.INCLUDE process_models/fastN_slowP.process
*.INCLUDE process_models/slowN_slowP.process
.TRAN 0.1u 2.3u 0.0
.END

